 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Shita Daiseijo wa, Seijo de Aru Koto wo Hitakakusu: ZERO ~The Great Saint of Remembrance~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生した大聖女は、聖女であることをひた隠すZERO ～The Great Saint of Remembrance～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated Great Saintess Hides Her True Identity with All Her Might"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the Kingdom of Nirv, the second princess was born with an apparent flaw—she had been blind since birth. Due to political conflicts, she was sent away from the capital to live in the Rint Forest, where everyone assumed she was just a fragile child, oblivious to the world around her. But the truth was far beyond what anyone imagined... She possessed extraordinary power that defied all expectations!\n\nWhen the king finally decided to bring her back, he sent the Vice Captain of the Holy Beast Knights, one of the strongest warriors in the kingdom, to escort her to the palace. However, upon meeting her, he immediately realized that this child was anything but ordinary—she radiated an immeasurable force, a power that could change the fate of the entire kingdom. How will this journey back unfold? Will the young Saintess remain hidden in the shadows, or will her strength one day be revealed?",
   "ja": "最強の騎士が出会ったのは、規格外の力を持つ幼き聖女だった──。ナーヴ王国には、目の見えない6歳の第二王女がいた。政争に巻き込まれることを憂いて王都から離れた「レントの森」で暮らしているが、国王は「連れ戻してほしい」と角獣騎士団副総長のシリウスを派遣し…。"
  },
